# Section
############################################################
Section::Begin("");

BEGIN_PGML
What is the value of [`T(60)\text{?}`]

[_]{$answer2}{10}

Which of the following is the best explanation of the meaning of this value in context?

[_]{$radio2}{5}

END_PGML

