static.solution:
T(x) = f(a) + \frac{f'(a)}{1!} (x-a) + \frac{f''(a)}{2!} (x-a)^2 + ... + \frac{f^n(a)}{n!} (x-a)^n



f'(x) = e^{x}
f''(x) = e^{x}



So, in this case, 



T_2(x) = e^{0.6}+e^{0.6}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.6\right)+\frac{e^{0.6}}{2}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.6\right)^{2}



|e^{x} - T_2(x)| = \left|e^{0.6}+e^{0.6}\mathopen{}\left(-0.5\right)+\frac{e^{0.6}}{2}\cdot 0.25-e^{0.1}\right| = 0.0336533

